        {
          "id": "d34c57a8-145e-4635-aaab-326985bef92a",
          "tenantId": "cd06aee4-88cd-49be-be16-3b02c14cac1e",
          "moduleId": "9547c34c-0d1c-4533-b16a-a76fc0b24cde",
          "type": "HTML",
          "title": "Crea tu cuenta en FlutterFlow",
          "position": 5757,
          "content": {
            "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Crea tu cuenta de FlutterFlow gratis en el siguiente enlace: <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://app.flutterflow.io/create-account?referral_id=FEEGYsRZPuVSTRyaVuoLMlOiKYG3\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://app.flutterflow.io/create-account?referral_id=FEEGYsRZPuVSTRyaVuoLMlOiKYG3\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click aquí</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En esta primera lección del curso de Iniciación a FlutterFlow veremos como crear una cuenta completamente gratuita desde cero, un paso sencillo pero indispensable antes de entrar en materia.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"CURSO INICIACIÓN FLUTTERFLOW - Crear Cuenta FlutterFlow\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bQeiuz9cwKI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n"
          },
          "durationMinutes": null,
          "externalSource": "learndash",
          "externalId": "5757",
